e=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">2018.5.23.(수</font></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 5.25.(금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></font></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>신청방법</strong>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">날인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">한 후 연계전공 이수 포기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">원을&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">공동실험실습관 201호에 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>신청장소</strong>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">행정실&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 14.6667px;\">공동실험실습관 201호</span>)</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>신청서류</strong>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">연계전공 포기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">신청서 및 성적증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">원본</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">참고사항</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">연계전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 과목 중 주전공 교과목이 아닌 참여 전공 교과목의 이수학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">복수전공 또는 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 해당 전공학점으로 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">졸업 대상자 중에서 연계전공 이수자로 선발되었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수포기 신청을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">문의사항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">공동실험실습관 201호</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: ng; font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=